Allow the Nautilus inlining pass with clang/LLVM 22 and on arm64.
LLVM 22 moved PassPlugin.h to llvm/Plugins and bumped the plugin API to version 2;
the old include silently resolved to a stale API-v1 header and clang rejected the plugin.
On arm64, inlined bitcode carried +outline-atomics, so the JIT emitted calls to hidden
libgcc helpers (__aarch64_ldadd8_acq_rel) it cannot resolve; strip that feature before linking.

